WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:03.180
Well, hello. Is this an angel
coming to you from above?

2
00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:06.020
Nope, just me, K-von,
the hilarious half-Persian comedian,

3
00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:08.020
backlit in my hotel room.

4
00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:11.440
Guys, get your tickets now and support
the Persian New Year event,

5
00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:13.900
because I'm bringing comedy
to add to it.

6
00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:17.560
It's all happening. It's going to be
sold out, so don't miss it.

7
00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:20.260
Tell your friends, get the final tickets,
and I'll see you there.
